cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PLI-GATE: positronium lifetime physics for GATE, with the analysis code of a prompt-selection study"
abstract: >-
  A GATE 9.4.1 / Geant4 11.3 physics extension for positronium lifetime imaging
  that selects the ortho-positronium lifetime and yield by the material in which
  each positron comes to rest, from a provenance-tracked Tao-Eldrup and oxygen
  database, with the Ore-Powell three-photon channel. The release also contains
  the simulation macros, the analysis and figure scripts, the processed data and
  the registration files behind the paper "Material-dependent positronium
  lifetimes in GATE and prompt-selection bias".
